    "v2_accordion_cHztXE": {
      "type": "v2_accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_row_GziggW": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Premier Global open again?",
            "row_content": "<p>Premier Global as a company closed in 2022. However, the name, branding, leadership, and values are now part of Study Active, a trusted provider of fitness qualifications.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_zJkypx": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are Study Active courses the same as Premier Global’s?",
            "row_content": "<p>They’re even better. Our courses are nationally recognised, CIMSPA-endorsed, and built by the same experts who helped Premier Global grow.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_Yd8WnN": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What qualifications do you offer?",
            "row_content": "<p>Level 2 Gym Instructing, Level 3 Personal Training, Nutrition, Sports Massage Therapy, Pilates, and more.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_z3Cx7C": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I find copies of my certificates?",
            "row_content": "<p>Here at Study Active, we have acquired just the branding of Premier Global but we are not the same company you studied with. The company you studied with ceased training a few years ago and we have no access to any past student data, recourses or information.<br/><br/> <br/><br/>As you are a former Premier Global student, you will need to contact their awarding body, Active IQ, with whom students would have been registered. They should be able to assist you further.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_wari9H": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I still trust the Premier Global name?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The brand lives on through Study Active, backed by the original leadership team and a new commitment to modern training.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_dxneVy": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the training still flexible and online?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Learn at your own pace, from anywhere, with optional in-person workshops at our immersive residential training retreats.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_AJnYxp": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are you still CIMSPA-accredited?",
            "row_content": "<p>We go one step further! Study Active has been awarded CIMSPA’s “Enhancing” rating, the highest possible quality score.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_mArhwK": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I get job opportunities after qualifying?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Our learners get guaranteed interviews with national gym chains like The Gym Group and Nuffield Health.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_4xWFUp": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need any prior qualifications?",
            "row_content": "<p>You can start with a Level 2 qualification if you’re new to fitness. Level 3 courses build on this foundation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_gQWFUx": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What kind of jobs can I get after qualifying?",
            "row_content": "<p>Gym Instructor, Personal Trainer, Fitness Influencer, Freelance Trainer, Gym Owner.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
